# Build context is the repository root for both images.

# Python
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.pyc
apps/server/tests/

# Node
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.pnpm-store

# Runtime / local state — nested paths matter: `apps/server/.env` and
# `apps/server/data/` must never be baked into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
data/
apps/server/data/
*.log

# Tooling / VCS metadata
.git/
.github/
docs/
eval/
fixtures/
e2e/
assets/models/
assets/thumbnails/